Rule 4 (1D scale tensor must match the last dimension of input x)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 1 ∧ ndim(v_2) = 1 ∧ shape(v_2, 0) = shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1)
>>
Rule 5 (input x should have a floating-point data type)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) = 6 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 7 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 8
>>
Rule 8 (shape compatibility between x and loc tensors along all dimensions)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = ndim(v_2) ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, i)
